	<div class="container wow bounceInLeft"  data-wow-offset="100" >
    	<div class="row">
        	<div class="col-md-12">
            	<h1 class="welcome-title"> Employee <span>Self Service</span></h1>
          
                <div class="desc text-center">Rapid industrialization has boosted the number of employees needs in the organization. Thus, handling employee queries becomes a tedious task for the HR department. Using Employee Self Service, employees can view informations like attendance summary, punch events, attendance details, leave balance, holiday and work schedules. Additionally, the reporting head can approve or reject leave and tour applications apart from this he can plan work schedules of his subordinates.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
