  <div class="container  "  >
      <div class="row wow bounceInLeft"  data-wow-offset="100">
           

          <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-4"><img class="img-responsive" src="~/LandingAssets/images/subpag/EditProfile.jpg"></div><div class="col-md-9 col-sm-8">

    <h3>View and Edit User Profile</h3>
    <p>Attendance tracking for the field or remote employees presents several challenges to HR person. Field employees can directly login into the minop App and mark attendance without going to the office. Apart from this, system also inform about its whereabouts during office hour to track and monitor its productivity while working in a field.</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
  <div class="row wow bounceInRight"  data-wow-offset="100">
           

